### ==============================================================================
### Distributed Logistics & Dispatch Platform - REST API Test Harness
### Base URL: http://localhost:5229 or http://192.168.0.104:5229
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5229

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. AUTHENTICATION & IDENTITY
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Register Customer Account
# @name registerCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice.customer@example.com",
  "password": "CustomerSecurePass123!",
  "fullName": "Alice Customer",
  "phone": "+15551234567",
  "role": "Customer"
}

### 1.2 Login Customer
# @name loginCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice.customer@example.com",
  "password": "CustomerSecurePass123!"
}

@customerToken = {{loginCustomer.response.body.accessToken}}

### 1.3 Register Courier Account
# @name registerCourier
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bob.courier@example.com",
  "password": "CourierSecurePass123!",
  "fullName": "Bob Courier",
  "phone": "+15559876543",
  "role": "Courier",
  "vehicleType": "Car",
  "plateNumber": "NY-LOG-5421",
  "makeModel": "Toyota Prius",
  "color": "Silver",
  "year": 2022
}

### 1.4 Login Admin (Seeded Admin credentials)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@logistic.local",
  "password": "Admin1234!"
}

@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 1.5 Login Courier
# @name loginCourier
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bob.courier@example.com",
  "password": "CourierSecurePass123!"
}

@courierToken = {{loginCourier.response.body.accessToken}}

### 1.6 Get Current User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 1.7 Issue Short-lived WebSocket Ticket for go-gateway
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/ws-ticket
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 1.8 Fetch RFC 7517 Public JWKS (Used by Go services for local JWT validation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/.well-known/jwks.json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. COURIER ADMINISTRATION & STATUS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Admin: List Pending Courier Applications
# @name getPendingCouriers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/couriers/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

@pendingCourierId = {{getPendingCouriers.response.body[0].id}}

### 2.2 Admin: Approve Courier Registration (Transitions to Offline, emits courier.registered)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/couriers/{{pendingCourierId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2.3 Courier: Get Own Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/couriers/me
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}

### 2.4 Courier: Update Availability Status to 'Available' (Syncs Redis GEO set)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/couriers/{{pendingCourierId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Available"
}

### 2.5 Dispatcher / Admin: List Couriers (Paginated & Filtered)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/couriers?status=Available&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2.6 Get Courier Detail by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/couriers/{{pendingCourierId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. ORDERS LIFECYCLE (INTAKE, QUERY, TRANSITIONS, CANCELLATION)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Customer: Create Order with Idempotency-Key (Emits order.created outbox event)
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: idempotency-req-alpha-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "priority": 1,
  "vehicleType": "Car",
  "packageDescription": "Electronics - Laptop and charger",
  "packageWeight": 3.25,
  "stops": [
    {
      "sequence": 1,
      "type": "Pickup",
      "address": "770 Broadway, New York, NY 10003",
      "latitude": 40.7308,
      "longitude": -73.9912,
      "contactName": "Warehouse Depot A",
      "contactPhone": "+15551112222"
    },
    {
      "sequence": 2,
      "type": "Dropoff",
      "address": "350 5th Ave, New York, NY 10118",
      "latitude": 40.7484,
      "longitude": -73.9857,
      "contactName": "Customer Front Desk",
      "contactPhone": "+15553334444"
    }
  ]
}

@createdOrderId = {{createOrder.response.body.id}}

### 3.2 Idempotency Test: Resend identical request (Assert: returns cached response without duplicate creation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: idempotency-req-alpha-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "priority": 1,
  "vehicleType": "Car",
  "packageDescription": "Electronics - Laptop and charger",
  "packageWeight": 3.25,
  "stops": [
    {
      "sequence": 1,
      "type": "Pickup",
      "address": "770 Broadway, New York, NY 10003",
      "latitude": 40.7308,
      "longitude": -73.9912,
      "contactName": "Warehouse Depot A",
      "contactPhone": "+15551112222"
    },
    {
      "sequence": 2,
      "type": "Dropoff",
      "address": "350 5th Ave, New York, NY 10118",
      "latitude": 40.7484,
      "longitude": -73.9857,
      "contactName": "Customer Front Desk",
      "contactPhone": "+15553334444"
    }
  ]
}

### 3.3 Idempotency Conflict Test: Reuse same key with different body (Assert: 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: idempotency-req-alpha-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "priority": 5,
  "vehicleType": "Truck",
  "stops": [
    {
      "sequence": 1,
      "type": "Pickup",
      "address": "Different Address",
      "latitude": 40.0,
      "longitude": -73.0
    },
    {
      "sequence": 2,
      "type": "Dropoff",
      "address": "Different Address 2",
      "latitude": 40.1,
      "longitude": -73.1
    }
  ]
}

### 3.4 Get Order Details by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{createdOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 3.5 Customer: List Own Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 3.6 Dispatcher / Admin: List All Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?status=Created&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3.7 Customer: Cancel Order before pickup (Emits order.cancelled outbox event)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{createdOrderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Change of schedule"
}

### 3.8 Courier: Pickup Order (Only valid if order status is 'Assigned')
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{createdOrderId}}/pickup
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}

### 3.9 Courier: Deliver Order (Only valid if order status is 'PickedUp')
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{createdOrderId}}/deliver
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}
